   alpineseries.tv\n          </p>\n          <h1 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mt-1 leading-tight\">\n            Alpine Series: Ridge Lines at Dawn\n          </h1>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n            Follow the crew as they cross the eastern ridge before sunrise, with field notes, drone\n            footage and a full uncut trail sequence.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-3 flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <div\n                class=\"size-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-chart-2 flex items-center justify-center\"\n              >\n                <iconify-icon\n                  icon=\"ph:play-fill\"\n                  class=\"text-white\"\n                  width=\"20\"\n                  height=\"20\"\n                ></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold truncate\">Episode 04 trailer</p>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Loads after you press play</p>\n              </div>\n              <iconify-icon\n                icon=\"ph:dots-three\"\n                class=\"text-muted-foreground\"\n                width=\"20\"\n                height=\"20\"\n              ></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-3 flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <div\n                class=\"size-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-chart-3 to-destructive flex items-center justify-center\"\n              >\n                <iconify-icon\n                  icon=\"ph:microphone-stage\"\n                  class=\"text-white\"\n                  width=\"20\"\n                  height=\"20\"\n                ></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-